SUMMARY:Workshop 1 - Operator Algebras: Groups and Dynamics
DESCRIPTION:Operator Algebras: Approximation\, Rigidity and Dynamics. Workshop 1 - Operator Algebras: Groups and Dynamics September 28 to October 2\, 2026 - IHP\, Paris Summary The workshop will feature talks on the latest developments on the interaction between operators algebras\, group representation theory\, group actions\, topological dynamics and ergodic theory. List of speakers: Goulnara Arzhantseva Uri Bade\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/14375/
