SUMMARY:CATS 8 - A conference in honour of Gabriele Vezzosi's 60th birthday
DESCRIPTION:The 8 th edition of the "CATS" conferences will take place from September 28 th to October 2 nd \, 2026 at "La Vieille Perrotine" \, Île d'Oléron\, France CATS 8 will be the occasion to celebrate Gabriele Vezzosi's 60 th birthday\, and will be part of the ANR project " DAG-Arts: Derived algebraic geometry applied to representation theory and singularity of schemes ". Registration is open until Februar\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/15506/
